{"id":942215,"title":"12｜替换Transformer？HSTU召回算法原理","content":"HSTU算法作为生成式推荐系统的新基座模型，旨在探索替代传统Transformer结构的可能性。本文分为四个部分：HSTU模型结构分析、召回模式下的数据处理与训练、实验数据分析以及与Transformer的对比。HSTU通过引入U分支增强特征交叉能力，并采用相对位置和时间编码来优化Attention机制，从而更好地捕捉用户近期行为的相关性。此外，HSTU去除了FFN模块以提高计算效率。在召回任务中，HSTU通过序列化处理数据，使用采样softmax进行训练，并通过向量检索实现召回。实验表明，HSTU在多个数据集上优于SASRec等基准模型，特别是在参数规模增加时效果更佳。然而，HSTU的效果依赖于特定的数据构造方式，其优势在不同场景下可能有所差异。总体而言，HSTU为推荐系统提供了一种新的架构选择，但要完全替代现有方法仍需进一步验证。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":405934,"user_name":"muni","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":2061557,"ip_address":"北京","ucode":"E14FD4E324A6BB","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1f/74/f5/542fb70d.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1773393537,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":150852,"content":"hstu的item表征是随机初始化，跟着模型一起学的。","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":4424762,"ctime":1773742864,"ip_address":"新加坡","comment_id":405934,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101108201,"comment_content":"item表征从哪里来的","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":4424762,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/43/84/3a/3d745603.jpg","nickname":"傅聪Cong","note":"","ucode":"83729C2BAD5684","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":682432,"discussion_content":"hstu的item表征是随机初始化，跟着模型一起学的。","content_length":65,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1773742864,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"新加坡","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":405510,"user_name":"勇敢的大白","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1143364,"ip_address":"浙江","ucode":"8F82D24B43F3DE","user_header":"http://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/m